  "slug": "bar-service-order-form",
  "title": "Bar Service Order Form",
  "subtitle": "Issue a controlled beverage-service order covering periods, stations, staffing, product allocation, operating controls, changes, and closeout.",
  "description": "An original versioned operating order for an approved event bar program. It translates responsible-role decisions into service periods, station assignments, product allocations, nonalcoholic support, staffing, payment controls, exception handling, and accountable release.",
  "use_case": "Use only after the bar-service request and required venue reviews are approved. Distribute the current revision to service leads, reissue it for material changes, and close after stock, payment devices, issued property, and open incidents are transferred to their own accountable records.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
